            </div>
            <ul class="callout-list">
              <li><strong>Minimum Follower Count:</strong> You must have at least 10,000 authentic followers.</li>
              <li><strong>30-Day Video Views:</strong> You must have accumulated at least 100,000 authentic video views within the trailing 30 days.</li>
              <li><strong>Minimum Video Length:</strong> Only original videos with a duration of <strong>at least 60 seconds (1 minute)</strong> qualify for monetization.</li>
              <li><strong>Age &amp; Account Standing:</strong> The account holder must be at least 18 years of age, maintain an account in good standing with zero community guideline strikes, and reside in an eligible territory (e.g., United States, United Kingdom, France, Germany, Japan, South Korea, or Brazil).</li>
              <li><strong>Strict Content Originality:</strong> Duets, Stitches, screen recordings, movie clip re-uploads, and AI content scraped without meaningful commentary are disqualified.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
